{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"Prerequisite: Crystalkin (glassheart or shardmind) \n\r\nYou have learned to connect with other minds as easily as you connect ( or once connected) with the Mother Crystal by tapping into your nature as either a being of mind or a being of celestial light. You gain the following \r\nbenefits: \n\r\n- Increase your Intelligence, Wisdom, or Charisma score by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\r\n- You can communicate telepathically with any creature you can see within 60 feet of you. You don\u0027t need to share a language with a creature for it to understand your telepathic utterances, but the creature must be able to understand at least one language. If you have telepathy from another source, the range is doubled, and the target can also respond to you telepathically. \n\n- You know and can cast the Detect Thoughts spell as a bonus action instead of as an action, requiring no spell slot or components, and you must finish a long rest before you can cast it this way again. Your spellcasting ability for the spell is the ability increased by this feat. If you have spell slots of 2nd level or higher, you can cast this spell with them.","level":1}],"id":"Customec0f1911-1779-42fb-85a7-147308a520d8","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Crystal Telepathy [EAB] [SM] [R]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}